oring, failures and retries consume the same wall-clock budget.','all_variants_counted':True,'attribution_reserve':'Count all four full-data trials including both deterministic replay controls and scratch-construction costs. Retain >=12000s for authorized corrections, closest controls and paired-seed attribution; no seed/recipe override in candidate CONFIG. Paired seeds require a later authorized host interface; inaccessible repetitions are recorded as omitted.','assessment_reserve':'Retain >=6000s for freezing source/config/checkpoint hashes, final candidate/comparison/ablation suite and host assessment if authorized. Current phase has no held-out access and no final suite is selected; withhold all test feedback from open research.','stop_rule':'Never launch training/installations/agents here. Submit only syntax/source-checked candidate modules and proposal. Host must stop at min(remaining wall clock, hard deadline, per-trial cap); preserve failed and unknown-state costs, no blind retry. Skip/defer any experiment that would invade declared reserves; do not raise caps. Stop this branch if no new admissible discriminating contrast remains. No open research may use later closed assessment outcomes.'}}\nvariants=[]\nfor name,file,role,counts in [('id15_attr16','candidate.py','candidate','31212361/30946404/265957'),('id16_attr15','attribute15.py','candidate','31384556/31123719/260837'),('uniform15_replay','uniform15_control.py','control','30536464/30276907/259557'),('full16_replay','full16_control.py','control','32060453/31793216/267237')]:\n variants.append({'name':name,'file':file,'role':role,'config':configs[file],'note':'Prospective ID/attribute deletion factorial cell; source SHA256='+sha[file]+'. Predicted total/embedding/dense='+counts+'; actual counts and tensor parity require host verification. '+gates+' '+quality+' '+measurement+' Reproduction in this environment: python3 -m py_compile '+file+'. Numerical reproduction uses this standalone source and exact CONF